        },
        "de158e68-5d0d-4819-a625-e2dabdff87d1": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "100-Day Money-Back Guarantee",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "carret",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>We truly believe FreshWipes will make a difference – for both you and your dog.<br/><br/>That’s why we offer a <strong>100-day money-backguarantee</strong>.</p><p>You can try the product at home, in your own time.<br/><br/>Not completely satisfied? Then you’ll get your money back – no stress, no hassle.</p><p>For us, it’s more important that your dog gets the care they deserve than that you keep something you don’t love.</p><p><strong>You can read more about our satisfaction guarantee here.<br/></strong><a href=\"/pages/100-dagers-fornoydgaranti\" title=\"100-Day Satisfaction Guarantee\">100-Day Satisfaction Guarantee</a></p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_EGhYxC": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "DESCRIPTION",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>FreshWipes Start The Routine Kit</strong></span><br/><br/>Plaque builds up every day and can lead to bad breath, gum irritation, and costly dental treatments. FreshWipes gently lift away plaque and bacteria with a simple finger wipe, helping support cleaner teeth, fresher breath, and healthier gums in just seconds.<br/><br/><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>EyeWipes Start The Routine Kit</strong></span><br/><br/>Tear stains and moisture around the eyes can create the perfect environment for irritation and buildup. EyeWipes gently remove dirt, discharge, and staining while helping keep the eye area clean, comfortable, and healthy.<br/><br/><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Fresh Breath in 30 Days Ebook + Routine Tracker</strong></span><br/><br/>A step-by-step system designed to help you build a consistent dental care routine for your pet. Includes practical guidance, progress tracking, and simple daily actions to support fresher breath and healthier teeth.<br/><br/><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Tear Stain Comb</strong></span><br/><br/>Designed to safely lift away dried discharge, debris, and tear stain buildup around the eyes. The fine-tooth design helps keep the eye area clean while making grooming easier and more effective.<br/><br/><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Complete Eye Care System</strong></span><br/><br/>A complete eye health guide with an easy-to-follow routine tracker. Learn how to maintain cleaner eyes, reduce tear stains, and build healthy grooming habits that support long-term eye comfort.</p>",
            "page": "free-e-book-the-secret-to-a-sparkling-home-in-just-15-minutes-a-day",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_aFAiwA": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "SHIPPING & RETURNS",
            "heading_size": "medium",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "collapse_icon": "plus",
            "display_top_border": true,
            "open": false,
            "content": "<p>Every order includes tracked shipping so you can follow your package from our warehouse to your doorstep. Orders are processed within 1–2 business days, and most arrive within 6–12 business days.</p><p>We're confident you'll love the results, which is why every purchase is backed by our 100-Day Satisfaction Guarantee. If you're not happy with your experience, simply contact our support team and we'll make it right.</p><p>If your order arrives damaged, defective, or incorrect, we'll resolve the issue with a replacement or refund at no additional cost.</p>",
            "page": "",
            "margin_top": 24,
            "margin_bottom": 0
          }
        },
        "reviews_8UgFbe": {
          "type": "reviews",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "color_scheme": "background-1",
            "show_custom_bg": false,
