          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is FreshWipes a substitute for toothbrushing?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>FreshWipes are designed to make daily dental care easier by helping remove plaque and food buildup from your pet's teeth and gums. Many pet owners use them as a convenient alternative to traditional brushing.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_wWEXkL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can EyeWipes help reduce tear stains?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>EyeWipes help remove daily buildup around the eyes that can contribute to staining and irritation. Regular use helps maintain a cleaner, brighter appearance.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_3fRqLL": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How do I use the Tear Stain Comb?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Use the comb after cleaning around the eye area with EyeWipes. The fine teeth help gently lift and remove loosened debris while helping keep the fur around the eyes neat and tidy.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_4GGYLx": {
