          "settings": {
            "heading": "What's included in the Essential Duo Bundle?",
            "icon": "",
            "filled_icon": false,
            "row_content": "<p>Your Essential Duo includes:</p><ul><li>1 × FreshWipes (100 wipes)</li><li>1 × EyeWipes (100 wipes)</li><li>FREE Tear Stain Comb</li><li>FREE FreshWipes Dental Care Guide & Routine Tracker</li><li>FREE EyeWipes Care Guide & Routine Tracker</li></ul><p>Everything you need for cleaner teeth, fresher breath, and brighter eyes in one simple daily routine.</p>",
